{"id":"P065-1","subject":"P","unit":"P065","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P065-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n직렬공진회로에서 선택도가 60, mH ,\n    × Hz일 때, 저항 은 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 0.5          ② 1\n\n③ 1.2          ④ 1.5\n\n③ 2","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":634},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1315}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n어떤 회로에 sin°V의 전압이 인가될\n\n때, sin°A의 전류가 흘렀다.\n\n이 회로의 평균전력은 몇 W인가?\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":610},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":345}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객