xplanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n권수가 60인 코일에서 0.8초 동안에 0.6의 자속이\n\n변화한다면, 코일에 발생되는 유도 기전력의 크기는\n\n몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 15          ② 30\n\n③ 45          ④ 60\n\n⑤ 90","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":524},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m12-e1.webp","width":696,"height":454}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n상호유도 결합회로에서 1차측 코일의 인덕턴스와 권수가\n\n16mH , 권수가 100회, 2차측 코일의 인덕턴스가 4mH \n\n일 때, 2차측 권수는 몇 회인가? (단, 결합계수는 1이다.)\n\n\n① 20          ② 25\n\n③ 30          ④ 40\n\n⑤ 50","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":511}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\nCm의 선전하밀도가 균일하게 분포된 무한직선도체\n중심으로부터 1m 떨어진 점의 전계가 20Vm였다.\n\n무한직선도체 중심으로부터 4m 떨어진 점의 전계는\n\n몇 Vm인가?\n\n\n① 1.25         ② 5\n\n③ 10          ④ 40\n\n⑤ 80","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n지름이 40cm인 원형코일 중심의 자계가 2000ATm\n\n였다. 코일에 흐르는 전류가 2A 일 때, 권수는?\n\n\n① 200         ② 400\n\n③ 500         ④ 800\n\n⑤ 1000","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":557},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m15-e1.webp","width":696,"height":533}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n10kW, 200V의 직류 분권 발전기가 정격 운전을 하\n\n고 있는 경우, 이 발전기의 유기기전력은 몇 V인가?\n\n(단, 전기자 저항은 0.2Ω이고, 내부 전압강하 및 계자\n\n 전류는 무시한다.)\n\n\n① 190         ② 210\n\n③ 220         ④ 240\n\n⑤ 250","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1349}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n1차 전압이 3300V, 권수비가 15인 단상 변압기의 2차\n\n전압은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 110         ② 220\n\n③ 280         ④ 330\n\n⑤ 440","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":546}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n60Hz, 6극 3상 유도전동기의 정격부하시 회전속도가\n\n960rpm인 경우, 유도 전동기의 슬립은?\n\n\n① 0.1          ② 0.2\n\n③ 0.3          ④ 0.4\n\n⑤ 0.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":517},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":555}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n무부하 전압이 204V, 정격전압이 200V인 변압기의\n\n전압변동률은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":782}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n40kW, 2000/200V의 단상 변압기의 1차 환산 임피\n\n던스가 Ω일 때, 변압기의 %임피던스는 몇 \n\n인가?\n\n\n\n\n① 2           ② 2.5\n\n③ 4           ④ 5\n\n⑤ 10","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m20-e1.webp","width":696,"height":649}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n100kVA 단상 변압기 3대를 3상 결선하여 부하에 전력\n\n을 공급할 때, 선전류가 150A였다. 이 경우에 선간전압\n\n은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n   \n①            ②  \n\n   \n③            ④  \n\n   \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":536}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n3상 유도전동기의 동기속도가 600rpm, 회전자속도가\n\n540rpm일 때, 2차 효율은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 85          ② 90\n\n③ 92          ④ 95\n\n⑤ 98","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":698}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n다음 중 단락비와 비례하는 것은?\n\n\n① 동기 임피던스     ② 전압강하\n\n③ 효율         ④ 전기자반작용\n\n⑤ 안정도","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":963}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n다음의 각 설명에 해당하는 리액터는?\n\n ㉠ 제5고조파를 제거할 목적으로 사용된다.\n\n ㉡ 페란티 현상을 억제하기 위한 목적으로 사용된다.\n\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①    분로 리액터       직렬 리액터\n\n ②    한류 리액터       분로 리액터\n\n ③    직렬 리액터       분로 리액터\n\n ④    소호 리액터       직렬 리액터\n\n ⑤    직렬 리액터       소호리액터","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":625}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P065-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n최대출력 50MW인 화력발전소의 시간당 중유 소비량이\n\n8.6kL이라고 하면, 발전단에서의 열효율은 몇 인가?\n(단, 중유의 열량은 10000kcalL이다.)\n\n\n① 50          ② 45\n\n③ 40          ④ 35\n\n⑤ 30","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.23 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e24-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m25-e1.webp","width":678,"height":295},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e24-m25-e2.webp","width":696,"height":778}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
